<a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a><main class="wrap inner-page case-page academy-main" id="main-content"><section class="academy-page-hero"><div class="academy-breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href='/resources'>Explore MBK</a></div><div class="academy-kicker">projects <span> / MBK GLOBAL</span></div><h1 class="page-title" id="case-title">The thinking behind<br><em>the builds.</em></h1><p class="intro">A closer look at selected MBK projects—the goal, interface choices, implementation questions and lessons behind each build. These are honest project notes, with no invented client metrics or unverified claims.</p></section>
<section aria-labelledby="case-title" class="faq-hero case-hero">
<div class="faq-hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="faq-status-dot"></span> SELECTED WORK / CASE STUDIES</p><div class="faq-hero-actions"><a class='button button-primary' href='/projects'>Browse all projects ↗</a><a class='text-link' href='/contact'>Discuss a project ↗</a></div><div class="faq-proof-row"><div><strong>04</strong><span>Selected projects</span></div><div><strong>BUILD NOTES</strong><span>Goals and decisions</span></div><div><strong>IN PROGRESS</strong><span>Learn and improve</span></div></div></div>
<aside class="faq-hero-card case-side-card"><div class="faq-card-mark">✳</div><p class="eyebrow">BEHIND THE INTERFACE</p><h2 id="section-1">Good work is more than <em>screens.</em></h2><p>Each case study focuses on the problem, the approach and the details that make a digital product clearer and more useful.</p><a class="faq-card-link" href="#case-grid"><span>Explore the case studies</span><span>↓</span></a><p class="faq-card-foot">GOAL · APPROACH · LEARNING</p></aside>
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="case-grid-title" class="faq-workspace case-workspace" id="case-grid"><div class="faq-workspace-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">PROJECT NOTES / 01—04</p><h2 id="case-grid-title">Selected work.<br><em>Real learning.</em></h2></div><p>Explore the idea, design focus and project notes.</p></div>
<div class="case-study-grid">
<article class="case-study-card"><div class="case-card-visual market-visual"><span>MBK / 01</span><div class="market-graphic"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><small>MARKET DATA / UI</small></div><div class="case-card-body"><p class="eyebrow">CASE 01 / MARKET DATA</p><h3 id="section-3">MBK Markets</h3><p class="case-summary">Explore 10,000+ cryptocurrency coins with live market information and interactive candlestick charts for viewing price movement and market trends.</p><div class="case-tags"><span>10,000+ coins</span><span>Live market data</span><span>Candlestick charts</span></div><div class="case-card-links"><a href='/article-mbk-markets'>Read project notes ↗</a><a href="https://mbkmarkets.vercel.app/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Open project ↗</a></div></div></article>
<article class="case-study-card"><div class="case-card-visual tv-visual"><span>MBK / 02</span><div class="tv-graphic"><b>MBK</b><i>TV</i><small>MEDIA / DISCOVERY</small></div><small>CONTENT PLATFORM</small></div><div class="case-card-body"><p class="eyebrow">CASE 02 / MEDIA</p><h3 id="section-4">MBK TV</h3><p class="case-summary">An online TV destination for watching available live channels, including ARY, Geo, Green TV and Dawat-e-Islami, with streaming content organized for easy discovery.</p><div class="case-tags"><span>Live TV</span><span>Channel discovery</span><span>Streaming</span></div><div class="case-card-links"><a href='/article-mbk-tv'>Read project notes ↗</a><a href="https://mbktv.vercel.app/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Open project ↗</a></div></div></article>
<article class="case-study-card"><div class="case-card-visual tool-visual"><span>MBK / 03</span><div class="tool-graphic"><div class="tool-input">Paste a link… <b>↗</b></div><div class="tool-lines"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><small>UTILITY / WORKFLOW</small></div><div class="case-card-body"><p class="eyebrow">CASE 03 / UTILITY</p><h3 id="section-5">MBK Downloader</h3><p class="case-summary">Download videos from supported platforms such as YouTube, Instagram, Facebook and TikTok through a simple link-based workflow. Platform support can vary.</p><div class="case-tags"><span>Multi-platform</span><span>URL workflow</span><span>Download options</span></div><div class="case-card-links"><a href='/article-mbk-tools'>Read project notes ↗</a></div></div></article>
<article class="case-study-card"><div class="case-card-visual quran-visual"><span>MBK / 04</span><div class="quran-graphic"><b>نور القرآن</b><i>✧</i><small>LEARNING / CONTENT</small></div><small>READABLE EXPERIENCE</small></div><div class="case-card-body"><p class="eyebrow">CASE 04 / EDUCATION</p><h3 id="section-6">Noor-e-Quran</h3><p class="case-summary">A simple online Quran-reading experience designed to help visitors open and read Quran content in a calm, readable interface.</p><div class="case-tags"><span>Quran reading</span><span>Readable layout</span><span>Simple navigation</span></div><div class="case-card-links"><a href='/article-noor-e-quran'>Read project notes ↗</a></div></div></article>
</div></section>
